# 1Password secret references, not secrets — safe to commit.
# Consumed via `op run --env-file=secrets.env -- <command>`.
# Vault/item name is a placeholder; point it at your own vault before use.
#
# claude, codex, and antigravity are deliberately absent — all three
# authenticate with their own subscription/account login, and an env var
# key for any of them outranks that login, silently moving billing from the
# plan to per-token usage. See their justfiles' `start` recipes.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=op://Personal/OpenRouter API/credential
